## Input

- **`<N>`** — epic anchor number (`epic<N>_plan.md` must be `Status: confirmed`).
- **`stage <k>`** — optional; else earliest unfinished published stage.
- **`loops:<n>`** — override adversarial loop budget (baked default
  **{{ auto_adversarial_loops }}**).
- **`status`** / **`dry-run`** — report only; no confirm / no writes beyond reads.

## Steps

Follow `{{ agent_dir }}/skills/iflow-auto/SKILL.md` verbatim.

## Constraints

- Off-path; never auto-dispatched by `/iflow`.
- Stage 1: adversarial step is a stub — do not reopen or create issues here.
